SCOPE

This MIT licence covers the source code authored for this project, namely:

  * Analysis/**            the Python analysis pipeline, tests and figure scripts
  * Assets/Scripts/**      the Unity C# experiment scripts
  * Assets/CheckpointAction.cs
  * ill.py, build.sh, dist.sh, start.sh, gather_logs.sh, deploy.ps1, start.ps1

It does NOT cover:

  * Documentation and figures (README.md, INSTRUCTIONS.md, THESIS_METHODS.md,
    Analysis/README.md, Analysis/**/figures and the .pdf/.png figure outputs),
    which are licensed under CC BY 4.0 — see LICENSE-docs.

  * Bundled third-party code, plugins, binaries and art (Assets/UniCave/,
    Assets/OptiTrack/, Assets/NatureStarterKit2/, Assets/Standard Assets/,
    Assets/Scripts/Splines/, Assets/Scripts/Optitrack/, Assets/Textures/,
    Assets/Sounds/, Builds/, runTreadmillServer, runMotionBaseServer), each of
    which remains under its own terms — see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
